1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,278
Notice that do, does and did disappear, and the verb takes back its tense: what time does the bank open becomes what time the bank opens; why did she resign becomes why she resigned.

2
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:17,877
A yes no question needs if or whether as the link: do you know whether the result has come out?

